{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d3ce7c9f-21bf-49f3-a06c-1a4ef58a3648",
    "name": "Shopping Cart API",
    "description": "# Shopping Cart API\n\nIntegration tests for the **Shopping Cart Service** comparing MySQL and DynamoDB backends.\n\n## Getting Started\n\nThis collection uses **Environment Variables** for switching between Local and AWS targets.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Ensure you have your `Local` and `AWS` environments active.\n3. Select the appropriate environment from the top-right dropdown.\n\n| Variable | Local | AWS |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `baseUrl` | `http://localhost:8080` | `http://<alb-dns-name>` |\n\n## Endpoints\n\n### Health Check\n- **GET /health** - Returns `{\"status\": \"ok\", \"db_mode\": \"<mode>\"}` (200)\n\n### Cart Management\n- **POST /shopping-carts** - Creates a new cart (201)\n- **GET /shopping-carts/:id** - Retrieves a cart and its items (200)\n- **POST /shopping-carts/:id/items** - Upserts items to the cart (204 No Content)\n\n### Error Cases Evaluated\n- **404 Not Found** - Non-existent cart IDs\n- **400 Bad Request** - Invalid Cart ID (string instead of int for MySQL)\n- **400 Bad Request** - Missing `customer_id` upon creation\n- **400 Bad Request** - Missing or negative `product_id` / `quantity` upon adding items",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52400206",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/52400206-d3ce7c9f-21bf-49f3-a06c-1a4ef58a3648?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "health"
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Shopping Cart",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    var body = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_id', body.shopping_cart_id);",
              "    pm.test('Cart created', function() {",
              "        pm.expect(body.shopping_cart_id).to.not.be.undefined;",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customer_id\": 1001\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/shopping-carts",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "shopping-carts"
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
